# Super Admin workspace builder (P3-C)

Enable platform ops to **author, validate, publish, and assign** workspace metadata definitions from Super Admin — without editing `packages/workspaces/*` source.

**Doc SoT:** this file · **Nano spec:** `TEMP/p3/p3-c-workspace-builder.md` (historical local scratch `p3-c-workspace-builder.md`; not fresh-clone authority — see docs/audits/snapshots/2026-07-31/psr-2b-temp-authority-inventory.yaml) v1.3

**Status (2026-06-21):** doc complete · **implementation complete** (14/14 nanos) · P3-C EPIC gate ready

---

## Executive summary

| Layer | P3-C delivers |
|-------|----------------|
| **Publish API** | POST create definition + POST publish version + GET version payload |
| **Builder UI** | Palette, canvas, inspector, rules, headless preview, publish bar |
| **Club assign** | New tab reusing P3-A PATCH + API DTO already on `tenants-get` |
| **Audit** | `WORKSPACE_DEFINITION_PUBLISHED` + existing `TENANT_DEFINITION_*` |
| **RBAC** | Owner-only publish; admin/owner assign; support read-only |

---

## Goals

| Goal | Detail |
|------|--------|
| Publish pipeline | Immutable `workspace_definition_versions` rows (INSERT only) |
| Builder UI | Three-pane + preview — no drag-and-drop library required v1 |
| Tenant binding | Reuse `PATCH /platform/v1/tenants/:id/workspace-definition` |
| Denali safety | No `denali.*` in palette; zero `packages/workspaces/denali` diff |

## Non-goals (P3-C v1)

- Operator iframe preview of live club wizard
- Server-side draft storage (sessionStorage only)
- Visual drag-and-drop designer
- Metadata-only tenant without package overlay — P3-D
- `denali.*` field ids in builder palette
- Breaking schema migration / upcasters

---

## Industry alignment

| Pattern | Source | P3-C mapping |
|---------|--------|--------------|
| **Immutable publish** | [Lineo](https://github.com/NicolaiSchmid/lineo) — PATCH always creates new version frame | POST publish → INSERT version N+1 |
| **Form revisions** | [Form.io Form Revisions](https://form.io/features/form-revisions-form-json-schema/) | Full JSON snapshot per version |
| **Schema-first builder** | [FormEngine](https://formengine.io/react-form-builder-library/) — JSON export + runtime render | SDK validate before publish |
| **Deterministic revisions** | [FormForge](https://github.com/EvanSchleret/formforge) — immutable form revisions + strict validation | checksum + assertWorkspaceDefinitionPayload |
| **Audit append-only** | [JSON audit trail design](https://jsonic.io/guides/json-audit-trail) — actor, action, resource, timestamp | platform audit events with metadata |

---

## Three-layer architecture

```text
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ P3-C Authoring (Super Admin)                                     │
│  builder UI → validate → POST publish → audit                    │
└────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────┘
                             │ immutable INSERT
┌────────────────────────────▼────────────────────────────────────┐
│ P3-A Data plane (Postgres)                                       │
│  workspace_definitions + workspace_definition_versions           │
└────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────┘
                             │ flag + tenant binding
┌────────────────────────────▼────────────────────────────────────┐
│ P3-A Runtime (API ingress) + P3-B Widgets (web)                  │
│  resolveWorkspacePluginForTenantContext → operator wizard        │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

P3-C closes the **authoring gap** between export/seed (P3-A A4) and runtime loader (P3-A A3).

---

## Immutable versioning

```text
workspace_definitions (stable id + displayName + status)
  └── workspace_definition_versions (immutable payload snapshot per version)
```

| Action | Behavior |
|--------|----------|
| Publish vN+1 | `INSERT` new version row; **never UPDATE** prior `payload` |
| Latest | `max(version) WHERE publishedAt IS NOT NULL` |
| Tenant pin | `(workspaceDefinitionId, workspaceDefinitionVersion)` on `tenants` |
| Rollback | Repoint tenant — **no tour data migration** |
| Checksum | SHA-256 stable-sorted JSON |

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Builder UI
  participant BFF as /api/platform
  participant API as /platform/v1
  participant DB as Postgres

  UI->>BFF: POST .../versions { payload }
  BFF->>API: Bearer + X-Platform-Ops-Phone
  API->>API: validateWorkspaceDefinitionPayload
  API->>API: assertRendererAllowlist (P3-B)
  API->>DB: INSERT version N+1
  API->>DB: audit WORKSPACE_DEFINITION_PUBLISHED
  API-->>UI: 201 { version, checksum }
```

