## API surface

Auth: `Authorization: Bearer` + `X-Platform-Ops-Phone` (BFF injects from `platform_session` cookie).

| Method | Path | Role | Status |
|--------|------|------|--------|
| `GET` | `/platform/v1/workspace-definitions` | read | ✅ |
| `POST` | `/platform/v1/workspace-definitions` | write | ✅ N-001 |
| `GET` | `/platform/v1/workspace-definitions/:id/versions/:version` | read | ✅ N-001 |
| `POST` | `/platform/v1/workspace-definitions/:id/versions` | **owner** | ✅ N-001 |
| `PATCH` | `/platform/v1/tenants/:id/workspace-definition` | write | ✅ |

### POST create definition (201)

Request:

```json
{ "id": "climbing-club-v1", "displayName": "Climbing Club" }
```

Response:

```json
{ "id": "climbing-club-v1", "displayName": "Climbing Club", "status": "draft" }
```

Errors: `409 PLATFORM_DEFINITION_CONFLICT` if id exists.

### POST publish version (201)

Request:

```json
{
  "payload": {
    "id": "climbing-club-v1",
    "version": 1,
    "contractVersion": 1,
    "supportedWorkspaceTypes": ["starter"],
    "fieldRegistry": { "version": 1, "fields": [] },
    "ruleSet": { "rules": [], "matrixDimensions": [], "cells": [], "defaultCellId": "default" },
    "wizard": {
      "wizardMode": "classic",
      "railId": "default-rail",
      "roots": ["basics"],
      "inactiveFieldGroups": [],
      "wizardCapacityStepRedundant": false
    }
  }
}
```

Server rules:

- `payload.id` must match path `:id`
- Ignore client `version` — assign `getNextVersionNumber()`
- Reject hooks → `PLUGIN_FUNCTION_NOT_ALLOWED`
- Reject unknown composite ids → `PLATFORM_RENDERER_NOT_ALLOWED`
- Store `checksum` from `computeWorkspaceDefinitionPayloadChecksum`

Response:

```json
{
  "definitionId": "climbing-club-v1",
  "version": 2,
  "checksum": "abc…",
  "publishedAt": "2026-06-21T12:00:00.000Z"
}
```

### GET version (200)

```json
{
  "definitionId": "climbing-club-v1",
  "version": 2,
  "checksum": "abc…",
  "publishedAt": "2026-06-21T12:00:00.000Z",
  "payload": { "...": "WorkspaceDefinitionPayload" }
}
```

### Error catalog

| HTTP | Code | When |
|------|------|------|
| 401 | `PLATFORM_UNAUTHORIZED` | missing session |
| 403 | `PLATFORM_FORBIDDEN` | support publish / insufficient role |
| 404 | `NOT_FOUND` | unknown definition or version |
| 409 | `PLATFORM_DEFINITION_CONFLICT` | duplicate definition id on create |
| 422 | `PLATFORM_VALIDATION` | Zod / SDK validation fail |
| 422 | `PLATFORM_RENDERER_NOT_ALLOWED` | composite id not in allowlist |

