## Repository extensions (N-001)

Add to `WorkspaceDefinitionRepository`:

```typescript
async createDefinition(input: {
  id: string;
  displayName: string;
}): Promise<{ id: string; displayName: string; status: string }>;

async getNextVersionNumber(definitionId: string): Promise<number>;
// max(version)+1 or 1 if none
```

Publish service `publish-platform-workspace-definition-version.ts`:

```text
txn:
  1. getNextVersionNumber
  2. createPublishedVersion(...)
  3. update workspace_definitions.status = "published"
  4. appendPlatformAuditEvent(WORKSPACE_DEFINITION_PUBLISHED)
```

