## Route registrar (N-001)

Add to `platform-route-registrar.ts`:

```typescript
const WORKSPACE_DEFINITIONS_POST_PATTERN = /^\/platform\/v1\/workspace-definitions$/;
const WORKSPACE_DEFINITION_VERSION_GET_PATTERN =
  /^\/platform\/v1\/workspace-definitions\/([^/]+)\/versions\/(\d+)$/;
const WORKSPACE_DEFINITION_VERSIONS_POST_PATTERN =
  /^\/platform\/v1\/workspace-definitions\/([^/]+)\/versions$/;
```

Dispatch before 404 handler — mirror existing lazy import pattern for `workspace-definitions-list.ts`.

### N-001 implementation (2026-06-21)

| Module | Responsibility |
|--------|----------------|
| `create-platform-workspace-definition.ts` | INSERT `workspace_definitions` row (`status: draft`); `409` on duplicate id |
| `publish-platform-workspace-definition-version.ts` | Validate → allowlist → checksum → txn INSERT version + status `published` + audit |
| `assert-workspace-definition-renderer-allowlist.ts` | Reject `denali.*`, unknown `platform.*`, and non-allowlisted composite ids |
| `workspace-definitions-post.ts` | `assertPlatformOpsWriteRole` gate |
| `workspace-definitions-versions-post.ts` | `assertPlatformOpsOwnerRole` gate |
| `workspace-definitions-version-get.ts` | Authenticated read of immutable snapshot |

Version numbers are **server-assigned** via `getNextVersionNumber` (`max(version)+1`). Client `payload.version` is validated by SDK shape but ignored for persistence. Each publish INSERT creates a new row; prior rows are never UPDATEd.

---

## Publish validation pipeline

```text
JSON body
  → parsePublishWorkspaceDefinitionVersionBody (Zod)
  → validateWorkspaceDefinitionPayload (SDK)
  → assertWorkspaceDefinitionRendererAllowlist (P3-B isAllowedPlatformRendererId)
  → computeWorkspaceDefinitionPayloadChecksum
  → txn: createPublishedVersion + status published
  → appendPlatformAuditEvent(WORKSPACE_DEFINITION_PUBLISHED)
```

Allowlist logic (`assert-workspace-definition-renderer-allowlist.ts`):

```typescript
for (const field of payload.fieldRegistry.fields) {
  if (field.kind !== "composite" && field.id === field.canonicalPath) continue;
  if (isAllowedPlatformRendererId(field.id)) continue;
  throw new PlatformValidation("PLATFORM_RENDERER_NOT_ALLOWED");
}
```

Audit metadata: `{ definitionId, version, checksum, fieldCount, actorId }`.

