## BFF routes (apps/web)

Browser → `/api/platform/*` only. Template (from `subscription/mark-paid/route.ts`):

```typescript
export async function POST(req: Request, context: RouteContext): Promise<NextResponse> {
  const { id } = await context.params;
  const upstream = await proxyPlatformApi(
    req,
    `/platform/v1/workspace-definitions/${id}/versions`,
    { method: "POST", body: await req.text() }
  );
  return NextResponse.json(await upstream.json().catch(() => ({})), { status: upstream.status });
}
```

| BFF file | Upstream |
|----------|----------|
| `app/api/platform/workspace-definitions/route.ts` | GET list + POST create |
| `app/api/platform/workspace-definitions/[id]/versions/route.ts` | POST publish |
| `app/api/platform/workspace-definitions/[id]/versions/[version]/route.ts` | GET version |
| `app/api/platform/tenants/[id]/workspace-definition/route.ts` | ✅ PATCH assign |

`proxyPlatformApi` adds `Authorization` + `X-Platform-Ops-Phone` from `platform_session`.

