## Builder state machine

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> LoadPublished: open editor
  LoadPublished --> Editing: merge sessionStorage if newer
  Editing --> Editing: palette/canvas/inspector/rules
  Editing --> Validating: preview refresh
  Validating --> Editing: fix violations
  Validating --> Publishing: owner + zero violations
  Publishing --> Published: 201 response
  Published --> Editing: continue from new version
  Editing --> Discarded: clear sessionStorage
  Discarded --> LoadPublished: reload GET
```

---

## Draft state (client v1)

| Concern | Decision |
|---------|----------|
| Storage | React state + `sessionStorage` key `platform-builder:{definitionId}` |
| Server draft | **No** |
| Schema | `{ payload, meta: { basedOnVersion, editedAt } }` |
| Reload | GET latest version; prefer sessionStorage if `editedAt` newer |
| Discard | Clear storage + GET |

Default field on palette add:

```typescript
{
  id: "platform.photos",
  kind: "composite",
  canonicalPath: "photos",
  stepId: activeStepId,
  required: false,
}
```

Primitives: `id === canonicalPath`, kind from palette.

