## Preview panel (headless)

No operator iframe. Client-side only:

```typescript
import { PlatformWizardEngine } from "@app-tour/platform-core";
import { validateWorkspaceDefinitionPayload } from "@app-tour/workspace-sdk/metadata";
import { getStarterWorkspacePlugin } from "@app-tour/workspace-starter";
```

Steps:

1. `validateWorkspaceDefinitionPayload(draft)` → violation list
2. Build preview plugin: spread `getStarterWorkspacePlugin()` hooks + overwrite data fields from draft (same semantics as `adaptMetadataPayloadToWorkspacePlugin` — implement `buildPreviewPluginFromDraft(draft)` in `preview-panel.tsx`)
3. `PlatformWizardEngine.create(plugin).buildRenderPlan(...)` → step/field counts
4. Render `data-preview-violation-count={n}`

**Do not** import `@app-tour/workspace-denali` in platform tree.

---

## Rule matrix editor (v1)

Edit `ruleSet.rules` as list (max **20**):

```typescript
{
  id: string;
  when: { fieldId: string; operator: "eq" | "neq"; value: string };
  effect: { type: "hidden" | "required" | "disabled"; targetFieldId: string };
}
```

Evaluation stays in `platform-core` RuleEngine — builder only edits JSON.

