## Club assign tab (N-013)

API returns `workspaceDefinition` on `GET /platform/v1/tenants/:id` via `toPlatformTenantDetailDto`. Web `PlatformClubDetail.workspaceDefinition` + `tab-workspace-definition.tsx` wired (N-013).

`tab-workspace-definition.tsx`:

- Load definitions: `GET /api/platform/workspace-definitions`
- Current binding from `detail.workspaceDefinition`
- Save: `PATCH /api/platform/tenants/:id/workspace-definition`
- `isWriteRole = opsRole === "owner" || opsRole === "admin"`
- Publish **not** on this tab — builder only
- Marker: `data-tab="workspace-definition"`

Add tab to `PLATFORM_CLUB_DETAIL_TABS` + client tab strip (between billing and owner suggested).

